Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Mathematica notebook to generate Rademacher terms for ordinary \
representations.  Data has already been generated, but there are subsections \
where you can generate your own set of coefficients.  You don\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]t need to run these to do the analysis if you are happy \
with the coefficients that are already available.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.995898545475869*^9, 
  3.995898664514752*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"656bea75-9477-41ef-9fec-\
